            "id": "749480103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Debal",
            "text": "There aren't many honest folks like me these days, who earn their living through blood, sweat, and tears.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "749480104"
            ]
          },
          "749480104": {
            "id": "749480104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Debal",
            "text": "Why, if everyone in the Court of Fontaine was like me, fairness and justice would prevail in all business dealings."
